OL,3,GNEWSAGenetic test gave me a sense of
OL,4,Asecurity - mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA first-time mum with muscular
OL,7,Fdystrophy has encouraged women to take
OL,8,Fpart in a genetic study, saying it
OL,9,Foffers a "sense of security".
OL,11,FAnisa Iqbal, 32, from Bradford, is one
OL,12,Fof 1,500 women signed up to The
OL,13,FGeneration Study, which identifies over
OL,14,F200 rare genetic conditions in newborn
OL,15,Fbabies.
OL,17,FIqbal signed up for the study during an
OL,18,Fantenatal class before giving birth to
OL,19,Fher son Kiyaan, who is now two months
OL,20,Fold, because of her own genetic
OL,21,Fdisability, which she did not discover
OL,22,Funtil her teenage years.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
