OL,3,GNEWSAGenetic test gave me a sense of
OL,4,Asecurity - mum
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are so many conditions you
OL,7,Fprobably haven't even heard of or are
OL,8,Faware of that they can test for, and it
OL,9,Fcan be picked up very early on rather
OL,10,Fthan finding out about it later on,"
OL,11,Fshe said.
